{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05851","headline":"和使君五郎西楼望远思归 · 王维","name":"和使君五郎西楼望远思归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"高楼望所思，目极情未毕。\n枕上见千里，窗中窥万室。\n悠悠长路人，暧暧远郊日。\n惆怅极浦外，迢递孤烟出。\n能赋属上才，思归同下秩。\n故乡不可见，云水空如一。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05851.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05851","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}